# Android related — android/ was deleted 2026-08-05 (iOS-only). These stay so a
# stray Gradle/keystore artifact can't be committed by accident.
#
# /android/ itself is ignored because a merge resurrected it once (33715f82,
# 2026-08-08) and brought local.properties with it — which carries a live
# MAPS_API_KEY. `flutter` regenerates that tree on any Android-touching
# command, so ignoring the directory is the only thing that stops it coming
# back a second time. Recover from git history if it is ever genuinely needed.
/android/
.gradle/
*.jks

